HCH5 Control
Copyright MRDonnii

The HCH5 MKII support (gateway/mk2.py) uses the Dantherm Residential Modbus
register map – register addresses, data types, unit modes and alarm codes –
as documented by the Tvalley71/dantherm Home Assistant integration:

  Dantherm integration for Home Assistant
  https://github.com/Tvalley71/dantherm
  Licensed under the Apache License, Version 2.0
  http://www.apache.org/licenses/LICENSE-2.0

No source files were copied; the map was re-implemented with the Python
standard library.
